{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUBBLE HEAVENS</strong> is a 3D Platformer with a great focus on speed, precision platforming and linear exploration!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit your way throught a world designed around cleanliness and domestic higyene, sliding, bumping, twirling and capturing enemies and objects with soap bubbles to advance in this crazy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game is the fact you <strong>play as The Bubbler</strong> - a character made of bubbles, who <strong>can stick to walls and slide onto them - mostly, what you will be doing is...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping, Sliding, Pursuing, Capturing, Protecting, Carrying, Avoiding obstacles, Twirling, and DANCING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubbler is a creature you control made of bubbles created by a great scientist of this world - as it progresses through natural environments that resembles domestic open-air rooms, it get to know this weird places and the people living in it - including some old family members who brings interesting discoveries around the true nature of this higyenist society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game with a narrative about fraternity, segregationism, higyene and health, and innoccence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060940?t=1767630767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/556e0fd3573740b17c1ff5565569544069b4ddb8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767630767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/05ba090b166816d0c57cfadd8050beff28cfc438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767630767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/05ba090b166816d0c57cfadd8050beff28cfc438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767630767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUBBLE HEAVENS</strong> is a 3D Platformer with a great focus on speed, precision platforming and linear exploration!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit your way throught a world designed around cleanliness and domestic higyene, sliding, bumping, twirling and capturing enemies and objects with soap bubbles to advance in this crazy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game is the fact you <strong>play as The Bubbler</strong> - a character made of bubbles, who <strong>can stick to walls and slide onto them - mostly, what you will be doing is...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping, Sliding, Pursuing, Capturing, Protecting, Carrying, Avoiding obstacles, Twirling, and DANCING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubbler is a creature you control made of bubbles created by a great scientist of this world - as it progresses through natural environments that resembles domestic open-air rooms, it get to know this weird places and the people living in it - including some old family members who brings interesting discoveries around the true nature of this higyenist society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game with a narrative about fraternity, segregationism, higyene and health, and innoccence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Iridescent Studios","Cakito"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/48eb76e6967ca701984d54b1903ab74ce01103d5/header.jpg?t=1767630767","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060940/251106957/7b7fb7905df9290d51f5e30e2b34f8c48ae4ddb9/1760489601/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767573731","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060940/251106957/7b7fb7905df9290d51f5e30e2b34f8c48ae4ddb9/1760489601/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767573731","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060940/251106957/7b7fb7905df9290d51f5e30e2b34f8c48ae4ddb9/1760489601/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767573731","id":257218002,"name":"Twirling And Bubble Mode Showcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218002/c2ee2a7153be1a041ab1ea7315c8376f6eb58d0a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767573731"}],"name":"BUBBLE HEAVENS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 600 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 597 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Indie"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path